fast-delegate may retrieve model economics and capability metadata at runtime
from the BerriAI/litellm repository's model_prices_and_context_window.json.
Persisted snapshots retain the upstream repository, commit, path, and content
hash as provenance. This project does not vendor LiteLLM source code or its
pricing database.
